WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.889 --> 00:00:03.730
TheraBreath took the
burn out of mouthwash.

2
00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:07.140
The next job is giving more
people a reason to want it.

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.240
Sixty-five of every hundred
American households buy mouthwash.

4
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.300
Fourteen buy TheraBreath, which leaves
eighty-six who don’t buy it yet.

5
00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.690
In July, your team came out to
Norco and watched us make flavor.

6
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.030
Then Ross invited us to
Princeton, with this goal.

7
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.944
Our goal, as R&D, is to drive incremental
growth through flavor innovation

8
00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:32.184
by identifying and developing new
flavor experiences that both strengthen

9
00:00:32.184 --> 00:00:36.344
our appeal with existing loyal users
and create opportunities to attract

10
00:00:36.344 --> 00:00:38.410
new consumers to the franchise.

11
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.574
So on Monday, November ninth, from
ten to noon in the Darwin room,

12
00:00:42.574 --> 00:00:44.970
we’ll work through his
four objectives together.

13
00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:47.160
It’s a working session, not a pitch.

14
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.914
You’ll pick the three
trends that matter most,

15
00:00:49.914 --> 00:00:53.710
then taste four samples we made in
your Fresh Breath and Kids bases.

16
00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:56.110
They’re blind, and you’ll
score them on your phone.

17
00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:59.624
By noon, we’d like to agree
on up to three directions,

18
00:00:59.624 --> 00:01:01.624
each with an owner and a next sample,

19
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:03.264
and we’ll send everyone the write-up,

20
00:01:03.264 --> 00:01:04.760
The Flavor Playbook.

21
00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.044
Before you come, please answer the four
quick questions in your pre-brief,

22
00:01:09.044 --> 00:01:11.200
because everyone’s
answers open the morning.

23
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.440
And bring your phone.

24
00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:14.870
The Future of Freshness.

25
00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:17.080
See you in Princeton.

